"Cee was a human woman of Earth who ran a dog training school, reborn here as a spider."
"Her Earth memories were blocked; they return in pieces, with headaches."
"She was the watchtower spider of Sunvale, who once hid Renir's gem for Liora."
"She consumed a Divine Glimmercore, the Black Abyss Pearl, to become an Abyssal Sigilweaver."
"It is 1% absorbed, yet her aura is already immense; her path leads toward Divinity."
"She hopes that path will one day give her a humanoid form."
"She keeps the Bracelet of the Four Elements, a Divine artifact charged with three elements."
"She and Renir sank the Order's island laboratory from beneath."
"Now she is in the antkin anthill, worked hard spinning silk until her glands are spent."
"She wants Liora back with the group, and told Renir he must win her back."
